X-WR-CALDESC:One extra task a week, in place of part of that day's zone. D
 efault time: 6:30 PM, Monday to Friday (monthly and seasonal tasks sit ins
 ide that block at 6:35 PM). Move it to any time that suits you: open an ev
 ent, tap Edit, change the time, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (iPho
 ne) or 'This and following events' (Google). Safety: test any hack on a sm
 all hidden spot first, never mix bleach with vinegar or ammonia, and keep 
 vinegar and lemon off natural stone. Full safety notes are on page 3 of yo
 ur guide. CelestialPrintCanada
X-WR-CALNAME:Home Reset: Monthly Rotation
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Monthly task: Oven (Hack 3)
DTSTART:20260302T183500
DTEND:20260302T185000
DTSTAMP:20261018T120000Z
UID:6f06d5ad90228bb0ddee@celestialprintcanada
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=4;BYDAY=1MO
DESCRIPTION:Monthly Rotation\, Week 1\, Kitchen column. Do this in place o
 f part of today's zone\, so you still stop at 20 minutes.\n\nSpread baking
  soda paste (1/2 cup baking soda + about 3 tbsp water) inside the cool ove
 n tonight\, avoiding heating elements and the gas outlet. Close the door\,
  leave about 12 hours\, then wipe it out with a damp cloth and scraper\; s
 pray vinegar on any white residue and wipe again. Self-cleaning oven? Chec
 k your manual first.\n\nThis box comes around again in 4 months. Skipped i
 t? It just waits for its next turn.\n\nDefault time: 6:30 PM\, Monday to F
 riday (monthly and seasonal tasks sit inside that block at 6:35 PM). Move 
 it to any time that suits you: open an event\, tap Edit\, change the time
 \, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (iPhone) or 'This and following ev
 ents' (Google). Safety: test any hack on a small hidden spot first\, never
  mix bleach with vinegar or ammonia\, and keep vinegar and lemon off natur
 al stone. Full safety notes are on page 3 of your guide. CelestialPrintCan
 ada
