RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;INTERVAL=4;BYDAY=2MO
DESCRIPTION:Monthly Rotation\, Week 2\, Kitchen column. Do this in place o
 f part of today's zone\, so you still stop at 20 minutes.\n\nPop out the m
 etal filter (see your manual). Soak 15+ minutes in very hot water with dis
 h soap and 1/4 cup baking soda\, scrub gently with a soft brush\, rinse an
 d dry completely. Charcoal filters can't be washed\, only replaced.\n\nThi
 s box comes around again in 4 months. Skipped it? It just waits for its ne
 xt turn.\n\nDefault time: 6:30 PM\, Monday to Friday (monthly and seasonal
  tasks sit inside that block at 6:35 PM). Move it to any time that suits y
 ou: open an event\, tap Edit\, change the time\, then choose 'Save for Fut
 ure Events' (iPhone) or 'This and following events' (Google). Safety: test
  any hack on a small hidden spot first\, never mix bleach with vinegar or 
 ammonia\, and keep vinegar and lemon off natural stone. Full safety notes 
 are on page 3 of your guide. CelestialPrintCanada
