 eep the soak short.\n\nThis box comes around again in 4 months. Skipped it
 ? It just waits for its next turn.\n\nDefault time: 6:30 PM\, Monday to Fr
 iday (monthly and seasonal tasks sit inside that block at 6:35 PM). Move i
