DESCRIPTION:Monthly Rotation\, Week 3\, Bathroom column. Do this in place 
 of part of today's zone\, so you still stop at 20 minutes.\n\n1/2 cup baki
 ng soda\, then 1 cup vinegar. Wait 15 minutes\, flush with hot (not boilin
 g) water. This freshens\; it doesn't clear real clogs. Never follow a stor
 e-bought drain cleaner with vinegar.\n\nThis box comes around again in 4 m
 onths. Skipped it? It just waits for its next turn.\n\nDefault time: 6:30 
 PM\, Monday to Friday (monthly and seasonal tasks sit inside that block at
