 change the time\, then choose 'Save for Future Events' (iPhone) or 'This a
 nd following events' (Google). Safety: test any hack on a small hidden spo
 t first\, never mix bleach with vinegar or ammonia\, and keep vinegar and 
 lemon off natural stone. Full safety notes are on page 3 of your guide. Ce
